    {"templateId":"item.magic.implement","requiredChecks":["implement subtype present","spell references valid","activation present","charge or consumption model present","recharge or terminal behavior present","attunement and casting gate explicit"],"runtimeChecks":["spell activation","charge spending","recharge","burnout or consumption","failure behavior"],"blockingAmbiguities":["unresolved scroll or spell-orb persistence"]},
    {"templateId":"item.living.sentient-companion","requiredChecks":["item identity present","companion body statistics present","personality and communication present","bonding present","autonomy boundaries present","progression present","repair and destruction behavior present"],"runtimeChecks":["independent actions","relationship state","progression unlocks","death or destruction handling"],"blockingAmbiguities":["unresolved item versus creature projection"]},
